{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRODUCT GROUP PICKER (GRO HANDOFF item 19)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Shows separate products as if they were variants of one product (the store is on Grow, so Shopify's Combined Listings,
a Plus feature, isn't available). Rendered by snippets/product-info.liquid in place of the variant picker when
product.metafields.custom.product_group is set.

Data (Shopify admin):
* metaobject type product_group: name, option_label (e.g. "Collection"), products (ordered list of products)
* on each product: custom.product_group (the entry), custom.group_option_label (pill text, e.g. "First Stories"),
  custom.group_option_hint (line under the pills, e.g. "Under 5")

Markup and classes are the theme's own variant picker (block swatches), so it looks like every other picker. Each pill is
a plain link to that product, which is the no-JS fallback; with JS, <product-group-picker> (assets/voxblock.js.liquid)
swaps the page in place and sends vb_product_viewed for the newly shown product.

Products that aren't available (sold out, or not published so the reference is empty) are left out, except the one on
show. Nothing renders when fewer than two products are left.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the product on show [REQUIRED]
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_group = product.metafields.custom.product_group.value
  assign group_label = product_group.option_label.value | default: product_group.option_label | strip
  assign current_label = product.metafields.custom.group_option_label.value | default: product.title
  assign current_hint = product.metafields.custom.group_option_hint.value

  assign shown_count = 0
  for group_product in product_group.products.value
    if group_product == blank
      continue
    endif
    if group_product.available or group_product.id == product.id
      assign shown_count = shown_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
-%}

{%- if shown_count > 1 -%}
  <product-group-picker
    class="product-info__product-picker"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-product-handle="{{ product.handle | escape }}"
    data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}"
    data-product-type="{{ product.type | escape }}"
    data-variant-id="{{ current_variant.id }}"
    data-price="{{ current_variant.price | divided_by: 100.0 }}"
    data-group="{{ product_group.system.handle | escape }}"
  >
    <div class="variant-picker">
      <fieldset class="variant-picker__option">
        <div class="variant-picker__option-info">
          <div class="h-stack gap-2">
            <legend class="text-subdued">{{ group_label | escape }}:</legend>
            <span>{{ current_label | escape }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="variant-picker__option-values wrap gap-2">
          {%- for group_product in product_group.products.value -%}
            {%- if group_product == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- unless group_product.available or group_product.id == product.id -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}

            {%- assign option_label = group_product.metafields.custom.group_option_label.value | default: group_product.title -%}
            {%- if group_product.id == product.id -%}
              {%- assign selected = true -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign selected = false -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- render 'option-value', type: 'block', href: group_product.url, value: option_label, selected: selected -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if current_hint != blank -%}
          <p class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ current_hint | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </fieldset>
    </div>
  </product-group-picker>
{%- endif -%}
